{
  "bodyHash": "/7SXH7jsx8E=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/y8of9Gn.png\" width=\"749\" height=\"98\"></p><p>本模組是對 SoBiohazardous 的「<strong><a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding-java-edition/minecraft-mods/1283470-1-4-7-smp-forge-baked-goods-mod-beta-unique-food\" rel=\"nofollow\">烘焙食品模組</a></strong>」的重製版。此模組為遊戲新增了大量新食物與作物！</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>特色內容：</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">8 種新作物</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">150+ 種新食物</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">新蛋糕</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">新礦石與花卉</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\"><strong>由 OneLemonyBoii 製作的 1.16+ 版本請至 <a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xl-food-mod-plus\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處查看</a></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本專案現由 <strong>WinterNode</strong> 榮譽贊助。點擊下方圖片獲取專屬 Minecraft 伺服器並支持作者。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fclients.winternode.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d20\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/iUkXd38.png\" width=\"703\" height=\"126\"></a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>模組評測影片：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Z8l7F9AsKg0?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><div>&nbsp;</div><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LBUUMBP.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"697\" height=\"65\"></p><p>草叢與香草花：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>新草叢每區塊會掉落一個種子物品，且掉落模組中任何種子的機率均等。此外，模組設定檔可選擇禁用草叢、香草花與岩鹽的世界生成。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ktaqsU2.png\" alt=\"世界中自然生成的草叢與香草花\" width=\"900\" height=\"493\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>香草花可製作香草精，進而製成香草奶油：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/mzxAzcS.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://imgur.com/g8pZ5Qe.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n</div><div>&nbsp;</div><p>岩鹽：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>岩鹽可於地下生成：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/MUtuMe5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"900\" height=\"493\"></p>\n</div><div>&nbsp;</div><p>稻米、胡椒、玉米、黃瓜、生菜、洋蔥、番茄與草莓作物：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/WAmO3Ud.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"900\" height=\"493\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>稻米可用於製作奶油飯、炒飯與米麵包：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/OFOl9iQ.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://imgur.com/JwMcZdH.png\" width=\"180\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/yNdAJE8.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>胡椒可用於製作辣醬：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/G0YPhBN.png\" width=\"180\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>生玉米可加工為玉米，用於製作玉米麵包：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/VJAdrot.png\" width=\"180\" height=\"124\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://imgur.com/G13OoA5.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>番茄可用於製作番茄醬：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/PYWoyp2.png\" width=\"180\" height=\"124\"></p>\n</div><div>&nbsp;</div><p>麵團、起司等：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>生麵團、熟麵團：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/qT5iRRz.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://imgur.com/G8nAfuH.png\" width=\"180\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>麵包丁：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/lymgGQa.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>馬鈴薯麵包：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Mz0LsEI.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>法式長棍麵包：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/TPAXpFC.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>奶油：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ny362Gp.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>起司：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/b27TRKC.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>起司泡芙：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/FJqlqMw.png\" width=\"180\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>起司麵包：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Rrlqi43.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>洋芋片、鹹味洋芋片、辣味洋芋片：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/E4By6jz.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/LTdaIq2.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/QZKGlG9.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>洋蔥圈：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/IBYWBYA.png\" width=\"180\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>煎蛋：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/9rhrFms.png\" width=\"180\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>鬆餅：<br><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ymhJEjG.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>鬆餅（華夫餅）：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/izTcIiK.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://imgur.com/XOBX1k0.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>新月麵包卷：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/3QR2HZp.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>甜甜圈：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/U8kxeGy.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>糖霜甜甜圈：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/RPGHR9X.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>巧克力甜甜圈：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/jESfhpk.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>香草甜甜圈：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1mGNziM.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n</div><div>&nbsp;</div><p>傳統美食：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>墨西哥卷餅：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/WY6JIrS.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>義大利麵：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/eYk3H4j.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>千層麵：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/o9b74QQ.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>香腸卷：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Mi5Neec.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>法式火腿三明治：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/mgOaLrS.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>通心粉起司：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Z3NgqzS.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n</div><div>&nbsp;</div><p>肉類：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>生肉塊：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/yoZo7oK.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>火腿：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/I3H4p6y.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"109\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>香腸：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rtBK3XJ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>培根：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4W5pzGB.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>牛肉乾：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/KYYFALO.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>絞肉：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QsJqjZY.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>生雞翅：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Vqw1krk.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>熟雞翅：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nJ0Qs1A.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/8F2C3j5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>辣味雞翅：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kVpUWC6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>炸雞桶：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/BRV2zPh.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"></p>\n</div><div>&nbsp;</div><p>速食：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>上層麵包、下層麵包：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yklcAUN.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/s9owZNJ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>漢堡、雞肉堡、起司堡：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1TjnCVL.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/wthqhls.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/zUb6jeu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>熱狗：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/dticekt.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>墨西哥薄餅：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/C4pCHVe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>塔可：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/VJXy63A.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>墨西哥卷：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/g7wuGvZ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>烤肉串：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1B8LSjS.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>披薩切片：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/XZHitc9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"></p>\n</div><div>&nbsp;</div><p>三明治：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>雞肉三明治：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/dePJauv.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>培根生菜番茄三明治：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/pWaqyMn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>早餐三明治：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/36xJRvG.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>烤起司三明治：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Yau60H9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>冰淇淋三明治：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/S4JpaF3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"></p>\n</div><div>&nbsp;</div><p>壽司：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>海苔：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/w6jPZfP.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"180\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>太卷：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/yuAZ5a7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>反卷：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/lBtr5Il.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>押壽司：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Uj4sgtE.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n</div><div>&nbsp;</div><p>沙拉：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>碗：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/kUNVTEe.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>田園沙拉：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/tAv91OT.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>雞肉沙拉：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ha54fCD.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>凱撒沙拉：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/OX46lAB.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>洋蔥沙拉：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/KR5y5sD.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>塔可沙拉：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/eB4GASW.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n</div><div>&nbsp;</div><p>湯品與燉菜：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>碗：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/kUNVTEe.png\" width<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>派皮：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rmFk5Hs.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>苹果派、金苹果派：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/e0OPsFG.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/e9Ql9ZO.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>奶酪派、鸡肉派：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Uq9T3vg.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/41l2iwQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>巧克力派、培根派：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/FTtpos7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MKRMLud.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>鱼派：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kLo4srQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>草莓派：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/XmY1wyL.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>巧克力蛋糕：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/lBh0PCn.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>巧克力饼干蛋糕：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/8FbE2hF.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>奶酪蛋糕：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/6fJQQj1.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>地狱蛋糕：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/RtEeG7R.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>草莓蛋糕：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/LjdQyGc.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>南瓜蛋糕：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/AVUfgcq.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>披萨：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/2kqgr3Y.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n</div><div>&nbsp;</div><p>饮品：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>空罐：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/r4oPkhl.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>迅捷能量饮料：</p>\n<p>给予25秒的速度与 haste III 效果。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cVOEWVn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>健康能量饮料：</p>\n<p>给予30秒的生命恢复效果。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2Q3DhRA.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>潜行能量饮料：</p>\n<p>给予2分钟的夜视、速度与隐身效果。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Xglcm5z.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>强力能量饮料：</p>\n<p>给予2分钟的力量 II 与抗火 II 效果。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nYBGJZa.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>致命能量饮料：</p>\n<p>给予1分钟的中毒效果。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q1Otqbd.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>超级能量饮料：</p>\n<p>给予3分钟的夜视 III、跳跃提升、水下呼吸 II、速度、隐身 III、力量 III、生命恢复 II 与 haste 效果。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/IwnOxBu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>玻璃杯：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RbeBlJv.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>啤酒：</p>\n<p>给予5秒的反胃 II 效果。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/47JEyh3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>咖啡杯：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/7llwWUk.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>咖啡：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/9URZMww.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>卡布奇诺：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/qk8wjpx.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"108\"></p>\n</div><div>&nbsp;</div><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AlE5kl9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"710\" height=\"65\"></p><p>只要您给予适当的署名且不从中获利，就可以在您的模组包中使用我的模组！</p><p><strong>本作品采用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.gnu.org%252flicenses%252fgpl-3.0.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">GNU 通用公共许可证第三版（GPLv3）</a> 授权。</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tdZlZu8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"254\" height=\"64\"></h3><h3>&nbsp;</h3><h3><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:400\">开发人员</span></h3><ul>\n<li>SoBiohazardous - 前作者</li>\n<li>Igrek - 美术设计</li>\n</ul><h3><a href=\"https://github.com/mariot7/XL-Food-Mod#translators\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a><span style=\"font-size:24px\">翻译人员</span></h3><ul>\n<li>Focamacho - 巴西葡萄牙语本地化</li>\n<li>HeresHavi - 荷兰语本地化</li>\n<li>geogeooo59 - 法语本地化</li>\n<li>Pandory - 德语本地化</li>\n<li>kellixon - 俄语本地化</li>\n<li>Aemande123 - 简体中文本地化</li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>发现错误？有疑问或建议？请在 <a href=\"https://github.com/mariot7/XL-Food-Mod/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github</a> 上发布。</strong></span></p>",
